---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Guides" description="Practical guides for working with JSON, APIs, AI, and everyday developer tasks.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-4">Guides</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">In-depth guides connecting concepts to the tools that help you apply them. More guides are added regularly.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">No guides published yet — check back soon, or explore the <a href="/#tools" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline">full tool directory</a> in the meantime.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
